   "textLength": 372,
   "text": "Stacia Bourne (left) and her mother, Mary Jo Galusha, spend time with Bourne's children at Galusha's home in Newark, Delaware. Galusha, a retired schoolteacher, moved from Idaho to assist her daughter's family. With rising childcare costs in the U.S., grandparents are offering increased support.\n Lianne Milton for NPR\n hide caption\n toggle caption\n Lianne Milton for NPR",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
