   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 621,
   "text": "Several months later, her phone rang. \"I got a call that Stacia was expecting and that I better start planning on retiring,\" Galusha recalled with a laugh.\nShe retired from her job as a schoolteacher, packed up her belongings and drove cross-country in her red Volkswagen Beetle. The grandmother of five now lives in Newark, Del., and has since traded in the VW Bug for an SUV in order to fit two car",
