   "textLength": 194,
   "text": "Galusha spends time with her grandson, George, and her son-in-law, Michael Blacketer, at her home in Newark, Delaware.\n Lianne Milton for NPR\n hide caption\n toggle caption\n Lianne Milton for NPR",
