   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 220,
   "text": "\"The reality is that because this country hasn't invested in a childcare infrastructure that is flexible and affordable and reliable, grandparents are filling in the gaps that the service system leaves behind,\" she said.",
